<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>DotAI · 拼圖排版編輯器</title>
<style>__EDITOR_CSS__</style></head><body>
<header>
  <div class="brand-lockup">
    <img class="brand-logo" src="__BRAND_LOGO__" alt="DotAI" width="56" height="56">
    <div><p class="product-name">DOTAI COLLAGE STUDIO</p><h1>相片拼圖工作室</h1><p class="header-note">自由排版 · 相框移位 · 斜切構圖</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="header-actions"><span class="local-label">相片只在本機處理</span><button id="export-top" class="primary" disabled>下載 JPG ↗</button></div>
</header>
<main>
<aside class="panel left"><p class="section-kicker">01 / 排版設定</p><label class="ratio-row" for="ratio">比例<select id="ratio"><option value="1:1">1:1 正方形</option><option value="4:3">4:3 橫向</option></select></label><h2>29 款排版</h2><p class="hint">四張相、不同組合。每款都可以自由調整。</p><div id="layouts" class="layouts"></div><p class="small-note">切換版式會重設自訂相框及形狀，可以復原。</p><div class="divider"></div><h2>作品底色</h2><p class="hint">只改作品嘅外框及間距，唔會改工具介面。</p><div id="swatches" class="swatches" role="group" aria-label="作品底色"></div><p class="small-note">純白簡潔；淺藍柔和；深海藍沉穩。亦可以自選顏色。</p><div class="divider"></div><h2>留白與間距</h2>
<label class="range-label" for="margin">外框 <output id="margin-value">18 px</output></label><input id="margin" type="range" min="0" max="64" value="18">
<label class="range-label" for="gap">間距 <output id="gap-value">12 px</output></label><input id="gap" type="range" min="0" max="48" value="12">
<label class="range-label" for="radius">方框圓角 <output id="radius-value">0 px</output></label><input id="radius" type="range" min="0" max="64" value="0"><p class="small-note">留白控制仍跟版式嘅相框；手動移位後，用右邊位置／大小調整。</p>
</aside>
<section class="stage" aria-label="即時拼圖預覽"><div class="stage-top"><span id="layout-name">經典四格</span><span id="size-label">1:1 · 1080 × 1080</span></div>
<label class="mode-row" for="edit-mode">操作模式<select id="edit-mode"><option value="crop">① 拖相片：調整相片構圖</option><option value="frame">② 移相框：移位／拉右下角改大小</option><option value="cut">③ 斜切分界：拖四個端點</option><option value="shape">④ 自訂單張斜切形狀：拉頂點</option></select></label>
<div id="canvas-wrap" class="canvas-wrap"><canvas id="canvas" width="1080" height="1080" tabindex="0" aria-label="相片畫布。模式包括拖相片、移相框、斜切分界、自訂形狀。方向鍵可微調。"></canvas><img id="initial-preview" class="initial-preview" src="__PREVIEW_DATA__" alt="DotAI 配色四張示範圖拼圖"><div id="selection" class="selection"><span id="selection-label">相片 1</span></div><canvas id="edit-overlay" width="1080" height="1080" aria-hidden="true"></canvas></div>
<p class="stage-caption">揀模板 → 移相框／拉分界。編輯線唔會出現在 JPG。</p><button id="preview" class="preview-toggle" aria-pressed="false">隱藏選框，睇完整效果</button><div class="toolbar"><button id="undo" class="secondary" disabled>↶ 復原</button><button id="redo" class="secondary" disabled>↷ 重做</button><button id="reset" class="secondary">重設全部</button></div><div id="status" class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite">互動程式尚未啟動；目前顯示靜態預覽。</div><noscript>需要 JavaScript 才能編輯。</noscript></section>
<aside class="panel right"><p class="section-kicker">02 / 相片調整</p><h2>揀一張相片</h2><p class="hint">先換入你嘅相片，再調整構圖。</p><div id="photos" class="photo-list"></div><div class="position-actions"><button id="move-prev" class="secondary">← 換前一張</button><button id="move-next" class="secondary">換後一張 →</button></div><label class="replace-label">＋ 換入相片<input id="files" class="file-input" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" multiple></label><div class="divider"></div><h2 id="selected-title">調整相片 1</h2>
<div id="cut-controls" hidden><h2>共用斜切分界</h2><label class="range-label" for="cut-top">上端位置 <output id="cut-top-value">43%</output></label><input id="cut-top" type="range" min="15" max="85" value="43"><label class="range-label" for="cut-bottom">下端位置 <output id="cut-bottom-value">59%</output></label><input id="cut-bottom" type="range" min="15" max="85" value="59"><label class="range-label" for="cut-left">左端位置 <output id="cut-left-value">46%</output></label><input id="cut-left" type="range" min="15" max="85" value="46"><label class="range-label" for="cut-right">右端位置 <output id="cut-right-value">56%</output></label><input id="cut-right" type="range" min="15" max="85" value="56"><button id="cut-straight" class="secondary full">分界回正／重新連結</button><p class="cut-note">改共用分界會重新連結四格，重設手動相框位置及單張形狀；可復原。自由移位則用「移相框」。</p><div class="divider"></div></div>
<div class="shapes"><button id="shape-rect" class="secondary">四邊形</button><button id="shape-diagonal" class="secondary">單張斜切</button><button id="shape-circle" class="secondary">圓／橢圓</button></div><details><summary>其他形狀</summary><div class="shapes"><button id="shape-triangle" class="secondary">三角形</button><button id="shape-diamond" class="secondary">菱形</button><button id="shape-hexagon" class="secondary">六邊形</button></div></details>
<details><summary>單張形狀頂點精調</summary><label class="range-label" for="vertex">選擇頂點</label><select id="vertex" disabled></select>
<label class="range-label" for="point-x">頂點水平 <output id="point-x-value">50%</output></label><input id="point-x" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" disabled>
<label class="range-label" for="point-y">頂點垂直 <output id="point-y-value">50%</output></label><input id="point-y" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" disabled><button id="shape-reset" class="secondary full">還原此形狀</button></details>
<details><summary>相框位置／大小（px）</summary><div class="numbers"><label>水平 X<input id="frame-x" type="number" min="0" max="1000"></label><label>垂直 Y<input id="frame-y" type="number" min="0" max="1270"></label><label>寬度<input id="frame-w" type="number" min="80" max="1080"></label><label>高度<input id="frame-h" type="number" min="80" max="1350"></label></div><button id="frame-reset" class="secondary full">相框返回版式位置</button></details>
<details open><summary>相片構圖</summary><label class="range-label" for="zoom">縮放 <output id="zoom-value">100%</output></label><input id="zoom" type="range" min="100" max="300" value="100"><label class="range-label" for="pan-x">水平 <output id="pan-x-value">52%</output></label><input id="pan-x" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="52"><label class="range-label" for="pan-y">垂直 <output id="pan-y-value">53%</output></label><input id="pan-y" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="53"><button id="center" class="secondary full">相片置中／還原縮放</button></details>
<div class="divider"></div><button id="export-bottom" class="primary full" disabled>下載 JPG ↗</button><p class="export-note">1:1 或 4:3 · 無標題／標誌／編輯線<br>原相不變，相片只在本機處理<br>關閉前先下載；未儲存嘅編輯會消失</p><a id="download-fallback" class="download-fallback" hidden>按此儲存 JPG</a></aside>
</main>
<script id="photo-data" type="application/json">__PHOTO_DATA__</script>
<script>(function(){var s=document.getElementById('status');s.textContent='正在啟動編輯器…';window.addEventListener('error',function(e){s.textContent='啟動失敗：'+e.message;});window.addEventListener('unhandledrejection',function(e){s.textContent='啟動失敗：'+(e.reason&&e.reason.message||String(e.reason));});})();</script>
<script>__CORE_JS__</script><script>__APP_JS__</script>
</body></html>
